/ A div, not an aside: Action Text's sanitiser drops tags outside its safelist, and the
/ safelist is deliberately strict because it also governs whatever the author pastes.
div class="jn-callout jn-callout--#{block.tone}"
  .jn-callout__label= t("journal.blocks.callout.#{block.tone}")
  .jn-callout__body= block.body
